<title>USA: Viacom says to expand primetime schedule.</title>
<headline>Viacom says to expand primetime schedule.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Viacom Inc said its UPN television unit will expand its prime-time schedule to four nights in the first quarter of 1998 by adding Thursday evening programming.</p>
<p>UPN will feature a weekly science fiction fantasy on Thursdays, called &quot;UPN Thursday Night Sci-Fi Movie.&quot;</p>
<p>UPN will also add four new comedies to its lineup.  The comedies are &quot;Good News,&quot; &quot;Hitz,&quot; &quot;Head Over Heels&quot; and &quot;Clueless,&quot; UPN said.</p>
</text>
